# Generated by `node tools/polestar.js profession draft Alchemy --out` from Forever's client tables. Do not edit: rebuild with that command.
guide forever/professions/alchemy
title Alchemy 1-300
category Professions
levels 5-60
zone Azeroth

# Data:
# The Forever client's tables (recipes, skill thresholds, reagents, vendor
# prices) via wago.tools, with Classic Era filling the few spells and items
# they lack; pfQuest (vendors, drops, nodes) and a curated trainer list
# checked against npcs.json. Forever changed many thresholds, reagents and
# names from Classic, so Classic recipe tables do not apply.
#
# Trainers and vendors are smart targets: the engine sends each character to
# the nearest one of its faction. Farming spots are picked per faction.
#
# Recipe choice: cheapest expected cost to 300 (Classic skill-up chances:
# certain while orange, falling from yellow to grey), with gathered materials
# valued at 4x their vendor sell price; see tools/lib/professions/plan.js.
# Material counts are expected values; yellow and green crafts can take more.
#
# Route:
#     1-75  Elixir of Minor Defense (about 82)
#    75-85  Minor Mana Potion (about 16)
#    85-100 Lesser Discolored Healing Potion (about 19)
#   100-150 Holy Protection Potion (about 58)
#   150-165 Fire Oil (about 27)
#   165-175 Elixir of Fire Power (about 12)
#   175-200 Greater Discolored Healing Potion (about 39)
#   200-215 Draught of Water Walking (about 28)
#   215-225 Elixir of Defense (about 12)
#   225-230 Elixir of Defense (about 8)
#   230-250 Superior Discolored Healing Potion (about 28)
#   250-259 Stonescale Oil (about 20)
#   259-265 Draught of Detect Undead (about 11)
#   265-300 Elixir of Greater Defense (about 43)

step Apprentice Alchemy
  tip Alchemy runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 68s in all.
  train Alchemy Apprentice
  skill Alchemy 1
  buy 3371 x82 nearest

